{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hunter's Hand</i> is a tactical roguelike deckbuilder set in a world unraveling at the seams. Choose from powerful classes, each with unique cards and subclasses. Face monstrous Ancients\u2014eldritch horrors that twist time, poison the land, and devour hope itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udccf Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Deckbuilding</strong> \u2013 Build and evolve your deck every run with 100+ cards per class.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Combat</strong> \u2013 Each move counts. Your choices shape every battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Maps</strong> \u2013 New paths, encounters, and challenges every time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subclasses &amp; Relics</strong> \u2013 Unlock powerful synergies and adapt your strategy mid-run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cursed Biomes &amp; Bosses</strong> \u2013 Face the otherworldly Ancients threatening the world in 3 unique biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Lore &amp; Worldbuilding</strong> \u2013 Discover scattered clues to uncover the truth behind the Ancients.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640270?t=1765289566","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640270?t=1765289566","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/dbadd507654a074ecece18d2cf5e7caaec92b031/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765289566","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/dbadd507654a074ecece18d2cf5e7caaec92b031/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765289566","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed